ed in the EINECS, ELINCS, or NLP inventories.\n\n## Substance names and other identifiers\n\nExpand all Collapse all\n\nRegulatory process names\n\nSodium nicotinate\n\nEC Inventory\n\nsodium nicotinate\n\nPre-Registration process\n\nIUPAC names\n\nNicotinic Acid Sodium Salt\n\nC&L Inventory\n\nNicotinic acid sodium salt\n\nC&L Inventory\n\nnicotinic acid, sodium salt\n\nC&L Inventory\n\nSodium nicotinate\n\nC&L Inventory\n\nsodium nicotinate\n\nC&L Inventory\n\nsodium pyridine-3-carboxylate\n\nOther\n\nOther identifiers\n\n54-86-4\n\nEC Inventory, C&L Inventory, Pre-Registration process\n\nCAS number--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDSMZ Strains Producing Special Compounds or Enzymes (https://www.dsmz.de/fileadmin/user_upload/Collection_allg/Strains_Enzymes.pdf)\nciteturn34search12 [wordlim: 200] Published: 11.7 years ago; <tr><td><strong>Cycloviracins</strong></td><td></td></tr> ... <tr><td><strong>Cytovirin</strong></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Bacillus sp.</em></td><td>DSM 2523</td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Bacillus sp.</em></td><td>DSM 2524</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Cycloheximide</strong></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Streptomyces albulus</em></td><td>DSM 40492<sup>T</sup></td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Streptomyces griseus</em></td><td>DSM 40695</td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Streptomyces griseus</em></td><td>DSM 40817</td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Streptomyces griseus</em></td><td>DSM 40855</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Cycloheximide diastereo-isomers</strong></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Streptomyces albulus</em></td><td>DSM 40492<sup>T</sup></td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Cyclopiazonic acid</strong></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Penicillium aurantiogriseum</em></td><td>DSM 2016</td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Penicillium camemberti</em></td><td>DSM 1995</td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Penicillium commune</em></td><td>DSM 2211<sup>T</sup></td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Cycloserine</strong></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td><em>Streptomyces virginiae</em></td><t