. \nStammlösung: 50 mg/ml in H2O, PBS oder HEPES, der pH-Wert der Lösung darf wegen einer möglichen \nInaktivierung von Blasticidin S pH 7 nicht überschreiten. Lagerung bei -20 °C, nicht wiederholt einfrieren  \nund auftauen. \n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBRIJ™ 35 BIOREAGENTS B (https://nivina-bmc.com/media/document/fisherscientific-chemical-catalog_1614574801.pdf)\nciteturn34search17 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5.7 years ago; <tr><td colspan=\"3\">White Powder; ≥99.0%; BLA-S, Cytovirin; C₁₇H₂₆N₈O₅·HCl; F.W.\n<table id=\"e7\">\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\">L-Arginine Hydrochloride</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Quantity</td><td>Packaging</td><td>Cat. No.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>100g</td><td>Glass Bottle</td><td>BP372-100</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\">White Crystals or Crystalline Powder; 98.5 to 101.0%; C₆H₁₄N₄O₂·ClH; F.W. 210.58; CAS [1119-34-2]; Melting Point: 226° to 230°C; Boiling Point: 235°C; Recommended Storage: Room Temperature</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table id=\"e8\">\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\">Blasticidin S Hydrochloride</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Quantity</td><td>Packaging</td><td>Cat. No.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>25mg</td><td>Amber Glass Bottle</td><td>BP2647-25</td></tr>\n<tr><td>50mg</td><td>Amber Glass Bottle</td><td>BP2647-50</td></tr>\n<tr><td>100mg</td><td>Amber Glass Bottle</td><td>BP2647-100</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\">White Powder; ≥99.0%; BLA-S, Cytovirin; C₁₇H₂₆N₈O₅·HCl; F.W. 458.69; CAS [3513-03-9]; Melting Point: 248° to 252°C (478.4° to 485.6°F); Recommended Storage: 0° to 5°C; From Streptomyces griseochromogenes; Not on TSCA inventory; for R and D use only; not for manufacturing or commercial purposes.</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table id=\"e9\">\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\">L-Ascorbic Acid</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Quantity</td><td>Packaging</td><td>Cat. No.</td></tr>\n<tr><td>500g</td><td>Glass Bottle</td><td>BP351-500</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\">White Crystalline Powder; ≥99.0%; Vitamin C; C₆H₈O₆; F.W. 176.13; CAS [50-81-7]; Mel